message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "GenAI Agents: Tutorials and Implementations for Generative AI Agent Techniques"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2024-09-09"
authors:
  - family-names: "Diamant"
    given-names: "Nir"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/GenAI_Agents"
url: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/GenAI_Agents"
abstract: >-
  A community-driven collection of 59 runnable Jupyter notebooks
  implementing Generative AI agents, from a single conversational bot to
  multi-agent systems, self-improving agents and complete applications.
  Covers LangGraph, AutoGen and PydanticAI orchestration, memory,
  tool use over MCP, evaluation and human-in-the-loop control.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - generative-ai
  - langgraph
  - autogen
  - multi-agent-systems
  - llm
  - mcp
  - agentic-ai
  - tutorials
